stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Boot: app start, Android perms
  Boot: DAT initialize + mock pair
  Boot --> Restored: open job in session.json
  Boot --> IDLE: no open job
  Restored: Restore job
  Restored --> RECONNECTING: app restarted
  IDLE --> DatPerm: Start job tapped
  STOPPED --> DatPerm: Start job tapped
  DatPerm: DAT camera + mic permission
  DatPerm --> Guard: granted
  Guard: Start guard
  Guard --> IDLE: off / folded / not worn
  Guard --> CONNECTING: glasses ready
  CONNECTING --> Setup
  RECONNECTING --> Setup
  Setup: Session setup loop
  Setup --> Setup: fail, backoff 1-30 s
  Setup --> ACTIVE: stream live
  Setup --> PAUSED: live, was paused
  ACTIVE --> PAUSED: pause / tap / doff
  PAUSED --> ACTIVE: resume / tap / don
  ACTIVE --> RECONNECTING: device lost
  PAUSED --> RECONNECTING: device lost
  ACTIVE --> STOPPED: end job
  PAUSED --> STOPPED: end job
  RECONNECTING --> STOPPED: end job
  CONNECTING --> STOPPED: end job
  STOPPED --> [*]
